+# DigiRig Local Whisper Fallback
+
+## Design
+The RX transcription path keeps OpenAI Realtime STT as the primary turn-boundary signal (`onSpeechStart` / `onTranscript`).
+
+On each RX utterance end, runtime now snapshots the captured RX PCM buffer, writes a temporary WAV as `PCM16 16k mono`, and optionally runs local `whisper` CLI.
+
+Transcript selection is:
+- use OpenAI realtime transcript by default
+- if `stt.localWhisper.enabled` and transcript is empty/garbled, use local Whisper output
+- if `stt.localWhisper.alwaysUse` is true, prefer local Whisper output every RX turn (fallback to realtime if Whisper fails)
+
+## Intended Outcomes / Requirements
+- Add a local transcription fallback path using `whisper` command.
+- Trigger fallback decision at RX end (STT transcript event).
+- Ensure audio handed to local Whisper is temp WAV in PCM16 / 16kHz / mono.
+- Add config surface for local Whisper controls:
+  - `stt.localWhisper.enabled`
+  - `stt.localWhisper.alwaysUse`
+  - `stt.localWhisper.model`
+  - `stt.localWhisper.command`
+  - `stt.localWhisper.args`
+  - `stt.localWhisper.timeoutMs`
+- Keep changes out of `node_modules`.
+
+## Flow
+1. RX speech starts (`onSpeechStart`): runtime resets metrics and RX PCM buffer.
+2. During RX (`capture.on("pcm")`): runtime appends mono PCM16 frames to the utterance buffer (when local Whisper is enabled).
+3. RX speech ends (`onTranscript`): runtime computes metrics, snapshots PCM buffer, normalizes realtime transcript.
+4. Fallback decision:
+   - if realtime transcript is empty/garbled, or `alwaysUse=true`, run local Whisper
+   - local Whisper path:
+     - resample to 16k mono PCM16 (linear interpolation)
+     - write temp WAV
+     - execute `whisper` with timeout
+     - read generated `.txt` transcript
+5. Selected transcript is passed to existing reply dispatch pipeline (`handleTranscript`).
+
+## Tradeoffs
+- Pros:
+  - Better resilience against dropped/garbled realtime transcript segments.
+  - Operator can force local Whisper consistently (`alwaysUse=true`).
+  - Minimal disruption to existing routing/reply behavior.
+- Cons:
+  - Added RX-end latency when local Whisper executes.
+  - Additional CPU load for local inference and resampling.
+  - Depends on external local CLI availability and model files.
+- Chosen constraints:
+  - Keep OpenAI realtime session for utterance boundary detection and timing.
+  - Clean temp artifacts after each transcription run.
+
+## Diff Summary (relative paths)
+- `src/defaults.ts`
+  - Added default constants for `stt.localWhisper.*`.
+- `src/config.ts`
+  - Extended STT schema with `localWhisper` object and defaults.
+- `src/config.test.ts`
+  - Added assertions for new local Whisper defaults/overrides.
+- `src/runtime.ts`
+  - Added RX PCM utterance buffering for fallback input.
+  - Added transcript quality heuristic (`isLikelyGarbledTranscript`).
+  - Added local Whisper runner with timeout, temp WAV generation, and transcript selection logic.
+  - Added audio helpers: resampling to 16k and WAV writer.
+- `README.md`
+  - Documented local Whisper fallback options and behavior.
+
+## Verification
+- Ran quick tests:
+  - `npx vitest run` (all tests passing)
